# Allow-list: send the build exactly what the image needs. Everything else stays
# out -- raw data (licence terms forbid redistributing it), the local .venv (built for
# macOS, useless on Linux), notebooks, caches, git history.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!src/
!models/odor-baseline-v1/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
